# IRONVOW: a chest that is a lidmaw bites (a fight; its loot after); the
# knight turned to the wall behind his first step who thrusts LANCE at it
# gets a word for his trouble; flames come from each floor's own pool (the
# Gaol's oozes and gnawwings, the Warren's grubs and chitins...).
seed 28
game ironvow
cheat newgame 5
cheat noflames
press LEFT
wait 8
press LEFT
wait 8
expect dir == 3
press B
press UP
press DOWN
press UP
waituntil casting == 0 200
expect easter == 1
# the lidmaw on floor 0
cheat pos 13 1 1
press A
wait 3
expect menu0 == 13
press A
wait 3
expect state == 15
expect fk0 == 2
cheat fhp 0 1
cheat spell 3
waituntil state == 16 60
press A
wait 40
press A
wait 3
expect shards == 4
